      "content": "PTC ThingWorx REST API provides programmatic access to the ThingWorx IoT platform including thing management, property read/write, service execution, event subscription, and mashup data APIs using Application Key or OAuth authentication. ThingWorx is PTC's industrial IoT platform for digital twin and connected factory applications.\n\nContact Support:\n Name: PTC Support",
